{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港郵政周二（10月27日）呼籲市民提高警覺，切勿在非官方途徑下載香港郵政流動應用程式。香港郵政澄清，官方流動應用程式目前只於Apple App Store、Google Play及華為AppGallery平台上架。如有查詢，可致電查詢熱線或電郵至香港郵政。</p><figure><img alt=\"香港郵政呼籲市民提高警覺，切勿在非官方途徑下載香港郵政流動應用程式。。(資料圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250722/1024121314023051264167495.jpeg/mqCQiQ9Zh7hEM3YJtOqN7jF6BOOa2yZW1eauTvDmrk4\"/><figcaption>香港郵政呼籲市民提高警覺，切勿在非官方途徑下載香港郵政流動應用程式。。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:00:47.389379+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T15:49:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T04:38:56.579811+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:32.915552+00:00","content_hash":"6799699bcf244903dd12efe92fb3c3dc40e12115c49ca8af14e3769afa81f0a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}